<title>MALAYSIA: Ekran shares to be suspended Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Ekran shares to be suspended Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian infrastructure developer Ekran Bhd has requested the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange to suspend trading of its shares at the opening of trade on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company said this in a statement late on Monday.</p>
<p>The suspension was being requested for an announcement, said Ekran.</p>
<p>No other details were given and company officials could not be immediately reached for comment.</p>
<p>Ekran shares closed 15 cents lower on Monday at 5.50 ringgit.</p>
<p>The company is the main developer of the Bakun hydro-electric dam in Sarawak state on Borneo island.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
